Rift Reference Brain — License

The reference brain (reflex-brain-rift-demo.rift) and the reference replay
(reflex-brain-rift-demo-replay.bin) are provided for demonstration and
verification only.

Permitted:
  - inspection
  - running through the reference implementation or the production binaries
  - redistributing as-is

Prohibited:
  - retraining
  - modification
  - using it as a starting point for a different brain
  - production use

For production brains, contact the Rift training service.
